### ===================================
### Todo Tasks API Tests
### Base Path: /todo
### ===================================

### ----- Task Management -----

### List Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/todo/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### List Tasks with Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/todo/tasks?status=pending&priority=high
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Create Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/todo/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete project documentation",
  "description": "Write comprehensive API documentation",
  "priority": "high",
  "dueDate": "2025-01-15"
}

###

### Create Task - Low Priority
POST {{baseUrl}}/todo/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Review code changes",
  "description": "Review pull requests from team",
  "priority": "low"
}

###

### Get Task by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/todo/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

> {%
    client.global.set("taskETag", response.headers.valueOf("ETag"));
%}

###

### Update Task (with ETag)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/todo/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
If-Match: {{taskETag}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Task Title",
  "status": "in_progress"
}

###

### Complete Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/todo/tasks/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Reset Task Status
POST {{baseUrl}}/todo/tasks/1/reset-status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Reset All Task Statuses
POST {{baseUrl}}/todo/tasks/reset-statuses
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Delete Task (to Trash)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todo/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ----- Trash Operations -----

### List Deleted Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/todo/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Restore Task from Trash
POST {{baseUrl}}/todo/trash/1/restore
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Permanently Delete Task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todo/trash/1
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Clear Trash (Delete All)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/todo/trash
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### ----- History & Analytics -----

### List Completed Tasks by Date
GET {{baseUrl}}/todo/history?date=2025-01-01
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get Monthly Analytics
GET {{baseUrl}}/todo/analytics/monthly?months=6
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get Summary Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/todo/analytics/summary?month=2025-01
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get User Ranking
GET {{baseUrl}}/todo/ranking/current
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Get Rank Definitions
GET {{baseUrl}}/todo/ranking/ranks

###

### ----- Import/Export -----

### Export All Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/todo/export/todo
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### Import Tasks
POST {{baseUrl}}/todo/import/todo
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tasks": [
    {
      "title": "Imported Task 1",
      "description": "Description 1",
      "priority": "medium"
    },
    {
      "title": "Imported Task 2",
      "description": "Description 2",
      "priority": "high"
    }
  ]
}
